flowchart TD
    %% --- PATH 2: VIBE-TO-ENTERPRISE RESCUE ---
    Start([💡 Pre-Existing Vibe-Coded Prototype<br>e.g., localhost:3000 or raw code]) --> Phase1

    subgraph P1Box ["Phase 1: Visual & Functional Discovery"]
        direction TB
        Phase1["🔍 skill: vibe-browser-audit<br>─────────────────────────<br>Crawl running application UI<br>Identify DOM structure & routes"]
        P1Analyze["💎 Salvage core domain logic (Preservation Gems)<br>⚠️ Identify security gaps & brittle patterns (Technical Debt)"]
        P1Report["📄 Generate DISCOVERY_REPORT.md"]
        Phase1 --> P1Analyze --> P1Report
    end

    P1Report --> Phase2

    subgraph P2Box ["Phase 2: Behavioral Safety Net"]
        direction TB
        Phase2["🧪 skill: vibe-behavioral-test-capture<br>─────────────────────────<br>Record active UI workflow traffic"]
        P2Tests["🧪 Generate tests/characterization/ safety net<br>Verbatim assertions of current outputs & mutations"]
        Phase2 --> P2Tests
    end

    P2Tests --> Phase3

    subgraph P3Box ["Phase 3: Interactive Extraction Loop"]
        direction TB
        Phase3["💬 State Machine: vibe-orchestrator-agent<br>─────────────────────────<br>Converts vibe audit to architectural scope"]
        P3QA[" Elicit key dimensions via interactive Q&A:<br>1. Scale & Tenancy<br>2. Data Sensitivity (PII/Security)<br>3. Ephemeral & State Storage<br>4. External APIs & Services<br>5. Cloud or On-Premises Target"]
        Phase3 --> P3QA
    end

    P3QA --> Phase4

    subgraph P4Box ["Phase 4: Canonical Contract & TOGAF Specs"]
        direction TB
        Phase4["🏗️ skill: vibe-togaf-architect<br>─────────────────────────<br>Consolidate specs/REQS.md (Authoritative Contract)<br>Scaffold specifications structure"]
        P4Docs["📝 Write specs/ folder:<br>• SYSTEM_CONTEXT.md (C4 Context)<br>• SEQUENCE_DIAGRAMS.md (Mermaid sequences)<br>• TECH_MAPPING.md & DEPLOYMENT.md"]
        Phase4 --> P4Docs
    end

    P4Docs --> TierGate

    subgraph GateBox ["🛑 Risk & Rigor Gate"]
        direction TB
        TierGate{"Confirm Alignment Check<br>─────────────────────────<br>SME/BAE reviews C4 specs & NFR maps"}
        TierGate -->|Refine / Gaps| Phase3
    end

    TierGate -->|Approved & Signed Off| Phase5

    subgraph P5Box ["Phase 5: Pure Domain Core Extraction"]
        direction TB
        Phase5["🧠 skill: vibe-domain-extractor<br>─────────────────────────<br>Extract pure logic from prototype controllers"]
        P5Domain["🧩 Generate /domain/ entities & rules<br>Enforce zero framework & zero I/O imports"]
        Phase5 --> P5Domain
    end

    P5Domain --> Phase6

    subgraph P6Box ["Phase 6: target Sandbox Scaffolding"]
        direction TB
        Phase6["📦 skill: vibe-spec-packager<br>─────────────────────────<br>Compile specifications into Spec-Kit"]
        P6Sandbox["🏗️ Bootstrap clean codebase sandbox target<br>Expose Port interfaces for DB & routing adapters"]
        Phase6 --> P6Sandbox
    end

    P6Sandbox --> Phase7

    subgraph P7Box ["Phase 7: Vertical Slice Migration"]
        direction TB
        Phase7["🔪 skill: vibe-slice-migrator<br>─────────────────────────<br>Progressive feature migration slice-by-slice"]
        P7Loop["🔄 Loop for each feature:<br>• Extract logic to App Use-cases<br>• Implement Concrete Infra Adapters<br>• Run Safety Net Characterization Tests<br>• Deprecate old legacy code paths"]
        P7Verify["✅ Final Safety Net Verification<br>Confirm 100% test pass against clean code"]
        Phase7 --> P7Loop --> P7Verify
    end

    P7Verify --> Done([✅ Hardened Production Clean Codebase Ready])

